{
  "title": "Oozy Gooey Australian Prawns Skewers",
  "description": "A jammy, gooey, date-night Australian dish featuring lemon juice, pickle, and ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly ingredients, perfect for a romantic dinner",
  "cuisine": "Australian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
